                   flag to LLiibbAAlliiaassSSeettMMooddee() has no effect.  See section
                   _N_E_T_W_O_R_K _A_D_D_R_E_S_S _T_R_A_N_S_L_A_T_I_O_N in ipfw(8) for more details.

