     _h_a_n_d_l_e_r___c_h_a_i_n keeps track of all the protocol handlers loaded, while
     _d_d_l___c_h_a_i_n tracks which userland modules are loaded.

     _h_a_n_d_l_e_r___c_h_a_i_n is composed of _s_t_r_u_c_t _p_r_o_t_o___h_a_n_d_l_e_r entries:

